18de-9c48-51d9-89ed-792967715125)) (global_label "SYSTEM_RET" (shape passive) (at 383.54 93.98 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left)) (uuid 3ce9f379-9168-5376-ac29-b779a51124d2)) (text "U2/U3 prevent external 5 V supplies backfeeding the shared converter rail.\nThey do not isolate the two downstream grounds from one another.\nAll SYSTEM_RET pins connect to the motor-board MCU ground." (at 25.4 175.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid 8ced9436-6ab4-5845-93f5-d5cd7ea2d76f)) (text "External throttle: ElectricScooterParts THR-38.\nRed = J8.1 (+5 V); black = J8.2 (return); white = J9.1 (signal).\nJ9.2 is the same return; use a suitable adapter harness.\nNominal 1-4 V signal becomes 0.554-2.214 V at J10.1.\nJ10.2 = return. Connect to motor-board PA6 ADC + ground.\nFirmware must calibrate throttle and require idle-to-arm." (at 208.28 154.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid 8391bd22-2fe1-5dd0-9f06-c2bbab0138da)) (text "Throttle is powered entirely from the isolated MCU-side supply.\nNo separate analog isolator is required within that same domain.\nMCU and comm use two separate 5 V/return output headers.\n5 V + return and signal + return split the 3-wire throttle over two headers." (at 208.28 208.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 9229c504-975e-578b-b6b1-5c949bfeee76)) (wire (pts (xy 48.26 45.72) (xy 55.88 45.72)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid abae056e-42f9-534f-959c-de15da09a6f0)) (wire (pts (xy 48.26 116.84) (xy 55.88 116.84)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid d0c325d9-e7f7-5923-aefc-5122d4c5c6bf)) (wire (pts (xy 68.58 68.58) (xy 68.58 76.2)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid b8fb5a2c-6078-57cf-a21d-01faaa2286bd)) (wire (pts (xy 68.58 139.7) (xy 68.58 147.32)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid 581cd9b3-9b49-5e48-b048-8683749a773f)) (wire (pts (xy 91.44 45.72) (xy 99.06 45.72)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid 5e66b93e-1a61-51d4-b699-84227ec51